<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/inspection-clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/inspection-clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/inspection-clipboard.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/island-claim-tools/">Claim tools</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Claim Timeline Builder</span></nav><p class="tag">Free planner</p><h1>Claim Timeline Builder: Map Your Policy Deadlines</h1><p class="lede">Policy deadlines keep running while you argue about a number. Enter your date of loss and your policy’s windows to build a timeline you can download to any calendar app.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool" data-tool="dates">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Claim timeline builder</span><i>Exports an .ics calendar file</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <div><label for="t-d">Date of loss</label><input id="t-d" type="date" name="dol"></div>
      <p class="hint nomargin">Change each window to match your own policy. The defaults are common placeholders, not legal advice.</p>
      <div class="days-grid">
        <div><label for="t-n">Report the claim within (days)</label><input id="t-n" name="notice" inputmode="numeric" value="3"></div>
        <div><label for="t-m">Temporary repairs within (days)</label><input id="t-m" name="mitig" inputmode="numeric" value="10"></div>
        <div><label for="t-p">Proof of loss (days)</label><input id="t-p" name="pol" inputmode="numeric" value="60"><span class="hint">Often counted from the carrier’s written request.</span></div>
        <div><label for="t-r">Depreciation recovery (days)</label><input id="t-r" name="rcd" inputmode="numeric" value="365"></div>
        <div><label for="t-s">Suit limitation (days)</label><input id="t-s" name="suit" inputmode="numeric" value="730"><span class="hint">Read the “Suit Against Us” clause for your number.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite">
      <ol class="timeline" data-o="timeline"></ol>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn small" data-ics>Download .ics calendar file</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="hint">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms; they are not a quote, an appraisal or legal advice. Default figures are illustrative.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap layout"><article class="prose">
<h2>The dates that matter</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Prompt notice.</strong> Policies require you to report a loss promptly. Late notice is a common carrier defense.</li>
<li><strong>Proof of loss.</strong> If the carrier asks for a sworn proof of loss, many policies give a fixed number of days to return it.</li>
<li><strong>Depreciation recovery.</strong> Replacement cost policies often require repairs within a set period to collect holdback — and after a major island disaster, contractor and permit backlogs can make that tight.</li>
<li><strong>Suit limitation.</strong> Policies limit how long you have to file suit. Invoking appraisal does not automatically pause that clock.</li></ul>
<div class="note"><b class="h">Important</b>The planner uses only the numbers you type in. It isn’t legal advice, and deadlines can be interpreted differently. If a date is close, contact a Hawaii attorney promptly.</div>
<h2>Using the calendar file</h2>
<p>The download is a standard .ics file. Open it on your phone or computer to add every milestone as an all-day event. Nothing is uploaded — the file is created in your browser.</p>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is the date of loss the day I found the damage?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Usually it is the date of the storm or event. Weather records for your area can help pin it down if you aren’t sure.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does appraisal extend my deadline to sue?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Not automatically. Some policies or written agreements address it, but many don’t, so protect the date independently.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="related"><a href="/island-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-check/"><small>Checklist</small><span>Appraisal Readiness Check</span><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/island-claim-tools/condo-deductible-share-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Condo Deductible Share Calculator</span><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/island-claim-tools/claim-gap-fee-estimator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</span><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="aside"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through first</h2><p>The first conversation is free. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="big" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn sun" href="/contact-hawaii-appraiser/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 7am–5pm HST</small></div><div class="box"><h2 class="box-t">All claim tools</h2><ul class="box-list"><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/roof-pitch-squares-estimator/">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Estimator</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">Hurricane Deductible Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/claim-timeline-builder/" aria-current="page">Claim Timeline Builder</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-check/">Appraisal Readiness Check</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/condo-deductible-share-calculator/">Condo Deductible Share Calculator</a></li></ul></div></aside></div><section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Want a professional to check the numbers?</h2><p>Send us your estimate and we’ll review it line by line.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-light" href="/contact-hawaii-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
